                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On October 24 President Truman proclaimed
                    that the state of war between the United States and the Government of Germany
                    had been terminated on October 19. For the text of the proclamation, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Foreign Policy, 1950–1955: Basic
                    Documents</hi>, volume II, pages 1723–1724, or 66 Stat. c3.</p>
            </div>
